    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN0020",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gobelin",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Texte Milonia",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Paysan\n\u0022Vous avez toute notre gratitude pour la lib\u00E9ration de notre ville ! Les gobelins ne cessaient de piller nos terres et de fouler aux pieds nos r\u00E9coltes... Il vaut mieux que vous soyez inform\u00E9s, ils sont tr\u00E8s nombreux, plus au sud.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN0023",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Texte Tanscroul",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ecuyer\n\u0022Merci de nous avoir lib\u00E9r\u00E9s ! La justice avait fui ces terres avant votre venue... Ils ob\u00E9issaient tous \u00E0 Erhog et nous \u00E9tions oblig\u00E9s de la servir !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Texte Agreban",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mage\n\u0022La famille Ammennir r\u00E9gnait sur ces terres avant qu\u0027Hubert de Lalye ne l\u0027accuse d\u0027h\u00E9r\u00E9sie. Depuis cette \u00E9poque, c\u0027est le chaos qui r\u00E8gne en ma\u00EEtre...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN0025",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gobelin",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Texte Port Jaignes",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lancier \n\u0022Hubert de Lalye, le conseiller personnel de l\u0027empereur, est venu maintes fois visiter cette cit\u00E9... Pourquoi ne nous aide-t-il pas \u00E0 contrer Erhog ? L\u0027empereur se pr\u00E9occupe peu de ces terres, je le crains !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN0026",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Erhog devant ville",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Erhog la t\u00E9n\u00E9breuse\n\u0022Ne soyez pas si confiant. Rappelez-vous, la Mort est ma ma\u00EEtresse ! Je la servirai en vous tuant... Ne soyez pas idiots, fuyez tant que vous le pouvez encore...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN0027",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN0028",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ev\u00E9nement2",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ranger\n\u0022Je sens l\u0027odeur \u00E2cre du soufre ! Avan\u00E7ons prudemment, nul doute que des d\u00E9mons sont pr\u00E9sents dans les parages...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ev\u00E9nement3",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ranger\n\u0022Regardez ! Les h\u00E9r\u00E9tiques ont tout br\u00FBl\u00E9...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Message T15",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Grand pr\u00EAtre\n\u0022L\u0027empereur a \u00E9t\u00E9 empoisonn\u00E9 ! Des nobles corrompus \u00E0 la solde d\u0027Erhog ont tent\u00E9 de l\u0027assassiner. Il vit encore, mais il ne tiendra pas longtemps si personne ne trouve un antidote au poison d\u0027Erhog !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ev\u00E9nement5",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ranger\n\u0022Nombreux sont les paysans qui nous ont mis en garde contre Castel Hasser. Ils disent que c\u0027est le refuge des \u00E2mes sans repos...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Message T3",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Grand pr\u00EAtre\n\u0022Seigneur, de nombreux aristocrates ont fui la capitale... Erhog et ses disciples mal\u00E9fiques sont s\u00FBrement derri\u00E8re tout \u00E7a ! Soyez prudent !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ev\u00E9nement7",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV000b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ranger\n\u0022Un homme de valeur r\u00E9side dans cette ville. Il s\u0027appelle Wolfgar. Il d\u00E9sire se joindre \u00E0 nous et combattre pour notre cause...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN002e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ev\u00E9nement8",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mage\n\u0022Nous avons trouv\u00E9 des symboles cabalistiques dans cette ruine ! Un puissant poison a \u00E9t\u00E9 concoct\u00E9 \u00E0 cet endroit, et r\u00E9cemment ! Je me demande pourquoi...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN002f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Message T20",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mage\n\u0022Seigneur, les \u00E9toiles nous parlent d\u0027un sauveur qui viendra \u00E0 notre secours ! Il sera de sang royal...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN0031",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Adepte",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN0032",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN0033",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Erhog T35",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Erhog la t\u00E9n\u00E9breuse\n\u0022Pourquoi vous opposer \u00E0 moi ? Votre sort est d\u00E9j\u00E0 scell\u00E9, laquais du Haut-P\u00E8re ! Ah ah ah ah !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orc",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Orque\n\u0022GHOOOOAAR ! Vous tomber dans pi\u00E8ge orque ! Vous combattre moi pour passer montagnes !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Victoire sc\u00E9nario",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Alors qu\u0027Erhog disparaissait sous les d\u00E9combres de sa tour, elle s\u0027\u00E9cria : \u0022Nous nous reverrons, supp\u00F4ts du Haut-P\u00E8re !\u0022  \nDans les ruines fut trouv\u00E9 l\u0027antidote dont l\u0027empereur D\u00E9mosth\u00E8ne avait tant besoin. Il lui fut envoy\u00E9 au plus vite.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "DoubleEv\u00E9nement",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ranger\n\u0022Redoublons de prudence... Il semble que les terres sous nos yeux soient celles des L\u00E9gions des Damn\u00E9s !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN0039",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lancier",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "StartEvent",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Grand pr\u00EAtre\n\u0022Enfin, seigneur ! Erhog et sa secte mal\u00E9fique ont la mainmise sur la r\u00E9gion... Les rares qui ont os\u00E9 \u00E9lever la voix ont myst\u00E9rieusement disparu. Son temple se trouve quelque part au sud. Vous devez mettre un terme \u00E0 cette folie !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN003a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "SousQu\u00EAteEv\u00E9nement",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ranger\n\u0022Seigneur, les paysans disent que l\u0027ogre a dissimul\u00E9 un objet dans son antre... Certains pensent m\u00EAme que cet objet est contemporain de la cr\u00E9ation de la statue qui se trouve plus au nord-est.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "SousQu\u00EAte2Ev\u00E9nement",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ranger\n\u0022L\u0027Anneau de pierre d\u0027Ammennir s\u0027adapte parfaitement au doigt de la statue ! Regardez, seigneur, une porte secr\u00E8te vient de s\u0027ouvrir... L\u00E0, un vieux livre !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN003d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Message T8",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Duc \n\u0022Quittez ces terres, humains... Mort cruelle et souffrances sans fins seront les seules r\u00E9compenses de ceux qui osent s\u0027opposer aux L\u00E9gions des Damn\u00E9s.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Archimage \n\u0022Ne faiblissez pas, seigneur ! Rien ne sert de paniquer... m\u00EAme s\u0027il semble qu\u0027Erhog se soit alli\u00E9e \u00E0 ces \u00EAtres d\u00E9moniaques !\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Duc \n\u0022Vous avez \u00E9t\u00E9 pr\u00E9venus, mortels ! Nous br\u00FBlerons vos terres et \u00E9corcherons vos cadavres...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S107SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S107UN003e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
